  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. Announces Compliance with Nasdaq Continued Listing Requirements",
  "summary": "Following the compliance plan submitted to the Nasdaq Hearing Panel, the Company has received confirmation from Nasdaq that it has regained compliance with the continued listing requirements set forth in Nasdaq Listing Rules 5550(b) (the “MVLS Rule”) and 5550(a)(2) (the “Bid Price Rule”), and will continue being listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market.",
